  "title": "Boulder 石",
  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull work-detail has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide work-detail__layout is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">Boulder 石</h1>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work-category/live/\" rel=\"tag\">LIVE</a></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<figure data-cover-orientation=\"landscape\" class=\"work-detail__hero wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img width=\"1537\" height=\"1023\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"《Boulder 石》演出現場\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover.webp 1537w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover-1024x682.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover-768x511.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1537px) 100vw, 1537px\" /></figure>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content work-detail__post-content wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Description</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">《Boulder》是一個關於勞動、人工/自然、有機/無機的音像演出並以遊戲引擎打造，他們遊蕩、推著石頭、徬徨不定，宛如現實中人類縮影，透過遊戲引擎、電腦音樂、沉浸聲技術匯集而成的「Boulder」，試圖解構與重構這些當代問題，為現代人提供一個重新思考自身存在的場域，引導觀眾在技術敘事與身體感知之間游移。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Created with game engines, Boulder is an audiovisual performance about labor, the artificial and the natural, the organic and the inorganic. Figures wander, push boulders, and hesitate—mirroring humanity in miniature. Combining game engines, computer music, and immersive sound technologies, Boulder seeks to deconstruct and reconstruct related contemporary issues, offering modern individuals a space to rethink their own existence, guiding the audience to drift between technological narratives and body perception.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>影像設計 | XTRUX</li>\n\n<li>聲音設計 | 曾竣偉、黃詠仁</li>\n\n<li>電子音樂演奏 | 陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>攝影 | 三月影像、陳彥齊</li>\n\n<li>臺灣聲響實驗室 | 黃意芝、陳家輝、溫泓凱、鄭詠心、曾靖軒、謝賢德、沈芸芳</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-27\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-27\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-819x1024.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — SnapInsta.to_558779785_826333550049130_2186448081618670124_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-819x1024.webp 819w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-240x300.webp 240w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-768x960.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-1024x683.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — 20251030聲響藝術節-開幕 精選 (40 of 58).jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1XjMHyprrDqgjEkWraywH9oZXrXd6Z8xl-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-1024x683.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — 2025聲響藝術節＿《新銳當代音樂聲響聯合展演》_XTRUX 、黃詠仁、陳柏豪-9981.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1CgeJm2veLHksXiIWxow-9P9L3sepK9uj-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"619\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-1024x619.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — 2025聲響藝術節＿《新銳當代音樂聲響聯合展演》_XTRUX 、黃詠仁、陳柏豪-0072.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-1024x619.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-300x181.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-768x464.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-1536x929.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1iTOJKbRbNmqMxuzUsaU29xHtRdlI7Rjh-2048x1238.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-1024x683.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — 20251030聲響藝術節-開幕 精選 (48 of 58).jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1rvltiicDOpacEcvzuZZ8zRTFmIc2k4PN-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure></div></section></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t\n</div>\n\n",
